<title>USA: Closure Medical prices share offer at $12.</title>
<headline>Closure Medical prices share offer at $12.</headline>
<dateline>RALEIGH, N.C. 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Closure Medical Corp said Thursday its offering of 1.5 million shares priced at $12.875 per share.</p>
<p>The company is offering 800,000 shares and 700,000 are being sold by a stockholder.</p>
<p>Lehman Brothers, Oppenheimer &amp; Co Inc and Sands Brothers &amp; Co Ltd are the managing underwriters of the offering.</p>
<p>The company granted the underwriters a 30-day option on an additional 225,000 shares.</p>
